{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31469","headline":"大云池泛舟 · 李羣玉","name":"大云池泛舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九月莲花死，萍枯霜水清。\n船浮天光远，櫂拂翠澜轻。\n古木□□□，了无烟霭生。\n游鳞泳皎洁，洞见逍遥情。\n渔父一曲歌，沧浪遂知名。\n未知斯水上，可以濯吾缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}